  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9e8f2fd1-f9bf-4c53-b1ce-b5c2fd361f2c"],
 " around one association. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["pairing", "TI"], "[", "\"\<\!\(\*StyleBox[\"key\", \"TI\"]\)\>\"",
    "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f86d0e5-3501-40d3-b618-9c4bd545e8b4"],
 " gives the value of a key, and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
